         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn this class we are going to learn the last table of the first group of numbers: the number three (3).\n\nThree is also a special number, because 3 is the number of dimensions we can see — length, width, and depth. And this is not the only subject we are going to highlight: in this class we will also discover that some answers can appear in more than one multiplication table at the same time.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "86742626-d3d6-4a8b-9c99-f356b6c65401",
